      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i was worried about being audited if i claimed it as a full business deduction. what if i'm only using it for work like 80% of the time? do i have to split the cost or can i just write off the whole thing if it's specifically for my studio? also i feel like i'm losing track of some of my smaller receipts, which is kinda stressful.",
