    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the help. i'll try to get more organized with a digital system. it's just frustrating because every time i think i've accounted for everything, i realize i've missed something small or a receipt has just vanished. does the irs have any specific rules about documentation if stuff goes missing or if i can't find a physical copy of a transaction?",
